graph TD
    %% External Phosphate
    A[Extracellular Phosphate Pi] --> B{OR: Pi<br/>Concentration?}
    B -->|High >20 μM| C[Sufficient Phosphate]
    B -->|Low <20 μM| D[Phosphate Starvation]
    
    %% High Pi - Pit System
    C --> E[Pit Constitutive Transport]
    E --> F[PitA/B H+ Symporters]
    F --> G{AND: Pi + H+<br/>Gradient?}
    G -->|No| H[No Transport]
    G -->|Yes| I[Pi-H+ Cotransport]
    I --> J[Cytoplasmic Pi]
    
    %% Low Pi - Pst System
    D --> K[PHO Regulon Induction]
    K --> L[PhoR/PhoB Activation]
    L --> M[pstSCAB Operon Expression]
    M --> N[Pst System Components]
    
    %% Pst System Assembly
    N --> O{AND: PstS + PstCAB<br/>All Present?}
    O -->|No| P[Transport Fails]
    O -->|Yes| Q[Functional Pst Complex]
    
    %% PstS Binding Protein
    Q --> R[PstS Periplasmic Protein]
    A --> R
    R --> S[PstS Binds Pi]
    S --> T[PstS-Pi Complex]
    
    %% ABC Transporter
    T --> U[PstS Docks with PstCAB]
    U --> V{AND: PstA + PstC<br/>Membrane Pore?}
    V -->|No| P
    V -->|Yes| W[Pi Transfer to Transporter]
    
    W --> X{AND: PstB ATPase<br/>AND ATP?}
    X -->|No| P
    X -->|Yes| Y[ATP Hydrolysis]
    Y --> Z[Conformational Change]
    Z --> AA[Pi Transported]
    AA --> J
    
    %% PhoU Regulation
    J --> AB[Intracellular Pi]
    AB --> AC{OR: Pi<br/>Level?}
    AC -->|High| AD[Pi Binds PhoU]
    AC -->|Low| AE[PhoU Free]
    
    AD --> AF[PhoU-Pi Complex]
    AF --> AG[PhoU Interacts with PstB]
    AG --> AH[/PhoU Inhibits PhoR/]
    AH --> AI[\PhoR Kinase Inactive/]
    AI --> AJ[/PhoB Not Phosphorylated/]
    AJ --> AK[PHO Regulon OFF]
    
    %% Low Pi - PhoR Activation
    AE --> AL[/No PhoU Inhibition/]
    AL --> AM[PhoR Autophosphorylation]
    AM --> AN[PhoR~P Formation]
    AN --> AO[Phosphotransfer to PhoB]
    AO --> AP[PhoB~P Active]
    
    %% PHO Regulon Activation
    AP --> AQ[PhoB~P Binds Pho Boxes]
    AQ --> AR{OR: Which PHO<br/>Gene?}
    AR -->|pstSCAB| AS[High-Affinity Transporter]
    AR -->|phoA| AT[Alkaline Phosphatase]
    AR -->|ugpBAEC| AU[Glycerol-3-P Transporter]
    AR -->|phnCDE| AV[Phosphonate Utilization]
    
    AS --> M
    
    %% Alternative Pi Sources
    AT --> AW[PhoA Secreted]
    AW --> AX[Cleaves Organic Phosphates]
    AX --> AY[Pi Released]
    AY --> A
    
    AU --> AZ[Import Glycerol-3-Phosphate]
    AZ --> BA[GlpQ Cleaves G3P]
    BA --> BB[Glycerol + Pi]
    BB --> J
    
    AV --> BC[Phosphonate ABC Transporter]
    BC --> BD[C-P Lyase]
    BD --> BE[Phosphonate → Pi]
    BE --> J
    
    %% Phosphate Utilization
    J --> BF{OR: Pi<br/>Use?}
    BF -->|Nucleotides| BG[ATP/GTP/CTP/UTP Synthesis]
    BF -->|Phospholipids| BH[Membrane Biosynthesis]
    BF -->|DNA/RNA| BI[Nucleic Acid Synthesis]
    BF -->|Phosphoproteins| BJ(\1)
    
    BG --> BK([Energy/Metabolism])
    BH --> BL([Membrane Growth])
    BI --> BM([Replication/Transcription])
    BJ --> BN["(\1)"]
    
    H --> BO([Pi Starvation])
    P --> BO
    AK --> BP["(\1)"]
    
